  "stability_fixes": [
    "VMApple machine id corrected from RFC-UUID semantics to the pinned uint64 machine property",
    "compiled P3.02 identity is validated, machine-id-bound and actually applied to QEMU",
    "P2.06, P3.06, P4.01, P4.02 and P4.03 generated fingerprints are recomputed before use",
    "P1.07 and P1.09 QEMU processes are cleaned up on interruption",
    "runtime run IDs originate at launch and cannot be regenerated by evidence collection",
    "P4.01 session, P4.02/P4.03 preflight and P4.02/P4.03 capture fingerprints are authenticated",
    "P4.04 re-authenticates plans and captures before admitting an A/B session",
    "empty or unstructured canonical traces cannot pass runtime evidence or promotion gates",
